codex
Root-cause inspection confirms the six issues map directly to the current implementation: the wide grid puts Plan and 
Build on different rows; Stay/link use baseline alignment; the services note is still inside the grid; the services 
link has an explicit copper override; mobile indents are `margin-left` rules; and the requested section spacing is 
absent. One wording in item 5 says “padding-left,” while the actual indent rules are `margin-left`; I’m removing those 
real indent rules while preserving the exact required `padding-left: 0px` measurement. First I’m adding the new 
browser assertions so the pre-fix state can be observed failing.
apply patch
